cmu-squad-visor-iff-on = Your optic's IFF comes online. Your gun will hold fire with a friendly in the line of fire.
cmu-squad-visor-iff-off = You switch off your optic's IFF.
cmu-squad-visor-grenades-on = Your optic will mark friendly primed grenades.
cmu-squad-visor-grenades-off = Your optic stops marking friendly grenades.
cmu-squad-visor-motion-link-on = Your optic links to your squad's motion trackers.
cmu-squad-visor-motion-link-off = Your optic stops showing your squad's motion trackers.
cmu-squad-visor-smartgun-blocked = {CAPITALIZE(THE($optic))} won't work while you're using a smartgun.
cmu-squad-visor-smartgun-switched-up = Your squad optic switches up. It won't work alongside a smartgun.

cmu-ammo-hud-button-tooltip = Toggle the squad optic ammo HUD
